  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The coefficient of static friction between two blocks is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and the table is smooth. The maximum horizontal force that can be applied to move the blocks together is _______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> (take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3e268f30-3a8e-41e4-808b-82bc28a049c2-image.png\" style=\"width: 281px; height: 88px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math> with relative rest, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></math> between</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> must be maximum.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c1088011-94de-47f8-ae39-7c426fe4d418-image.png\" style=\"width: 345px; height: 112px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mi>comm</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p>",
